alue of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in July to August and 51% in November to December. So far in 2026 it got 46% in February to March. Grid 18170 had its driest year in 2007 at 69%.</p>"}
